61	 * decides whether Better Auth can see it at all: `getSession` reads exactly one
62	 * name, the one `useSecureCookies` derives, and is blind to the other spelling.
63	 *
64	 * Values come back raw — only `getSession` can say which of them verify.
65	 * Matching is on the exact name before `=`, so a `<name>_other` cookie is never
66	 * mistaken for `<name>`.
67	 */
